  "problem": "What is the minor of ${d}_{32}$ in the matrix\n$D=[\\begin{aligned}3s & -{r}^{2} & 2t \\\\ -r & 0 & r \\\\ 5t & 4r & 1\\end{aligned}]?$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we remove the third row and second column:\n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}3s & \u2217 & 2t \\\\ -r & \u2217 & r \\\\ \u2217 & 4r & \u2217\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}3s & 2t \\\\ -r & r\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}3s & 2t \\\\ -r & r\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3s\\cdot r-2t\\cdot (-r) \\\\  & =3rs-(-2rt) \\\\  & =3rs+2rt\\end{aligned}\n$$",
